For cake-module products, Configured Options expands only to options enabled by effective configuration: Flavour, Egg Preference, Sweetener Type, Flour Type, and Size/Weight. Resolve state as Product explicit ON/OFF, then Subcategory explicit ON/OFF, then Main Category ON/OFF, otherwise OFF. Quantity remains available for every sellable product. Future category modules show their own configured options without empty cake fields.

